  "solution": {
    "text": "<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/J877EutIq-0mgVBZ6Y4DfAqifOGsZd5Iwwxf-5EWVS0.original.fullsize.png\"/>\n$\\mathrm{P}_1-\\mathrm{P}_0=\\frac{4 \\mathrm{~T}}{\\mathrm{r}_1}  \\qquad \\quad \\quad \\quad\\mathrm{P}_2-\\mathrm{P}_0=\\frac{4 \\mathrm{~T}}{\\mathrm{r}_2}$\n$\\begin{aligned} &amp; \\mathrm{P}_1-\\mathrm{P}_0=3\\left(\\mathrm{P}_2-\\mathrm{P}_0\\right) \\\\ &amp; \\frac{4 \\mathrm{~T}}{\\mathrm{r}_1}=3 \\frac{4 \\mathrm{~T}}{\\mathrm{r}_2} \\\\ &amp; \\mathrm{r}_2=3 \\mathrm{r}_1 \\\\ &amp; \\frac{\\mathrm{V}_1}{\\mathrm{~V}_2}=\\frac{\\frac{4}{3} \\pi \\mathrm{r}_1^3}{\\frac{4}{3} \\pi \\mathrm{r}_2^3}=\\frac{1}{27}\\end{aligned}$",
